    "m_FunctionBody": "float t = frac(UV.y * 5.0);\nfloat n = frac((UV.y * 5.0 - t) / 5.0 + Time * 0.1);\nfloat centered = t - 0.5;\nfloat tube = saturate(1.0 - centered * centered * 8.0);\n\nfloat r = saturate(1.0 - n * 2.0) + saturate((n - 0.6) * 2.5);\nfloat g = saturate(n * 3.0) * saturate(1.5 - n * 2.0);\nfloat b = saturate(n * 2.0 - 0.6) * saturate(1.0 - (n - 0.9) * 5.0) + saturate((n - 0.8) * 5.0) * 0.5;\n\nColor = float3(r, g, b) * tube;\nAlpha = 1.0;"
}

